      "end": 348,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "This matter is taken up through hybrid mode.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 349,
      "end": 393,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "1 2.  Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Addl.\nStanding Counsel.\n3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 394,
      "end": 479,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The petitioner is the informant in G.R. Case No. 205 of 2003.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 480,
      "end": 541,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "G.R. Case No. 205 of 2003",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 515,
          "end": 540
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "She has been examined as a witness in part in the ongoing trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 542,
      "end": 606,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "However, because of the connection with an earlier case involving the offence under Section 376 of IPC, prayer was made on behalf of the informant (witness) to hold camera trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 607,
      "end": 785,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 691,
          "end": 702
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 706,
          "end": 709
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "It is stated that the said petition was allowed by order dated 27.01.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 786,
      "end": 860,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "27.01.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 849,
          "end": 859
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Since massive construction work is presently going on in the Court building at Bhubaneswar, the informant sought for an adjournment on the ground that the in- camera trial would not be possible to be held.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 861,
      "end": 1066,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bhubaneswar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 940,
          "end": 951
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Instead of considering such petition, the Court below has posted the case to 31.08.2023 for production.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1067,
      "end": 1170,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.08.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1144,
          "end": 1154
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Since a petition for postponement of the criminal trial is pending, the Court below should have considered the same.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1171,
      "end": 1288,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "4. The CRLMC is therefore, disposed of directing the Court below to consider and dispose of the petition filed by the petitioner-witness for postponement of the in-camera trial to a further date.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1290,
      "end": 1485,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CRLMC",
          "label": "ORG",
